777198079", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593828091_986732780531412_7937147992795840961_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YdE5C3RD2OUQ7kNvwHYLsOr&_nc_oc=AdoV4KjBqV-HbVYA6F_z2jJStJoc9B2nJZsc_qS-rAPWyEfs_Mu45ImXJMRb0hIPMKQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1jrGmmGZG1JbPYzR7726Q4OR0ueM7nCV3Zv61YP2LIeQ&oe=69F61831"}, {"file_name": "SampleScene_Custom..._15.04.2026_18-55-08.png", "id": "1620413075896947", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819323_1620413079230280_5926825948282727640_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pI42K5tcsuEQ7kNvwHiTOZ0&_nc_oc=Adq6Dk8B1lT9RHT-hmXlwX-wFp4FLajShlsFtBs6gOLzsoZzarvLLxYx49KDSjRUtFA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1-vdyy8UFus6vWYFE1tY64gP2tU6Qqoptbv_kD5DjqDg&oe=69F6098F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Lethal Baboon", "keywords": ["baboon", "gorilla", "mods", "horror", "ape"], "long_description": "# Lethal Baboon\n\n**Enter a facility where survival isn\u2019t guaranteed\u2026 and silence is your only ally.**\n\nLethal Baboon is a fast-paced VR horror experience built around immersive gorilla-style locomotion. Move with your hands, climb, leap, and scramble through a dark, hostile facility overrun by unpredictable monsters.\n\n**You\u2019re not alone\u2014but you\u2019ll wish you were.**\n\nEvery sound you make could be your last. Hide in the shadows, navigate tight corridors, and outmaneuver creatures that are always hunting. They adapt, they listen, and they don\u2019t forget.\n\n**But you\u2019re not completely helpless.**\n\nScattered throughout the facility are powerful mods that enhance your abilities\u2014giving you a fighting chance. Upgrade your movement, unlock tools, and push back against the horrors lurking in the dark\u2026 if you\u2019re brave enough.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n\ud83e\udd8d Gorilla Locomotion Movement \u2013 Fully physics-based VR traversal for intense, immersive gameplay\n\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Stealth Horror Gameplay \u2013 Hide, evade, and survive against relentless monsters\n\u2699\ufe0f Upgradeable Mods \u2013 Discover and equip enhancements to fight back\n\ud83c\udfe2 Dynamic Facility Environment \u2013 Explore a maze of rooms, vents, and hidden paths\n\ud83d\udd0a Sound Matters \u2013 Your movement and actions can attract unwanted attention\n\nIn Lethal Baboon, every decision matters.\n\n**Run. Hide. Fight. Or get caught.**", "short_description": "Lethal Baboon is a fast-paced VR horror experience built around immersive gorilla-style locomotion. Move with your hands, climb, leap, and scramble through a dark, hostile facility overrun by unpredictable monsters."}]}, "developer_name": "Good Games Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/goodgamesstudio/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Good Games Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/goodgamesstudio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "26653348654326729"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_2017323592463310_1481416759688280514_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb